    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "本条只写 Lean `LongOnlyAlphaStreamAlgorithm.py`。经纪 `ALPHA_STREAMS`；宇宙 SPY/IBM；`EqualWeightingPortfolioConstructionModel(Daily, PortfolioBias.LONG)`+即时。`on_data`：若未投资则 `emit_insights([Insight.price(SPY,1日,UP), Insight.price(IBM,1日,DOWN)])`；断言成交后不得持有空头。不是仅 ConstantAlpha UP 核（W501），也不是 AddAlpha 一次性 DOWN×3 核（W506）。提出日期未知。空仓 emit SPY UP+IBM DOWN 且 LONG 偏差忽略空头+Alpha Streams ≠ 仅 ConstantAlpha UP（M3234）/三路 OneTime DOWN（M3237）。计入美股/ETF。提出日期按源文件原样保留未知。"
    },
